type: software
title: "Science Simulations: interactive physics, astronomy and cosmology simulations for teaching"
abstract: >-
  Collection of self-contained, offline-capable interactive simulations of
  mathematics, physics, astronomy, astrophysics, cosmology and high-energy
  physics, built as educational tools. They are didactic resources and have
  not been scientifically validated.
